          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_matthew_groh_mit_media_lab",
          "text": "This paper by Matthew Groh at the MIT Media Lab argues that the usual explanation, distribution shift, is the wrong frame.",
