          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_groh_introduces_context_shift_semant",
          "text": "Groh introduces context shift, the semantically meaningful changes in how data are created, collected, and curated that actually drive those failures, and lays out three concrete ways to address it: leaning on human intuition and expert knowledge, building dynamic benchmarks, and clearly stating a model's limitations.",
          "expected_role": "result",
