          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_but_these_definitions_over_specified",
          "text": "But these definitions are over-specified for comparing two data samples and under-specified for evaluating the data-generating process that actually drives the mismatch.",
