          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_figure_1_shows_interest_distribution",
          "text": "As Figure 1 shows, interest in distribution shift terminology has grown enormously over the last decade, with covariate shift papers alone climbing toward nine thousand per year by 2021.",
