        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_top_framing_groh_identifies_three",
          "text": "On top of that framing, Groh identifies three practical methods for closing the benchmark-to-production gap, and illustrates all of them through three recurring case-study domains: facial expression recognition, deepfake detection, and medical diagnosis.",
