          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c1_headline_evidence_how_wildly_perform",
          "text": "The headline evidence is how wildly performance swings with the benchmark. One facial expression model, built on AlexNet, ranges from just 48.6 percent accuracy on SFEW to 94.8 percent on MultiPie, against a random baseline of 14.2 percent, so which benchmark you pick determines the story you tell.",
